橙县&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Concert crowd of Angelinos emoting to Turnstile, view from stage at night." height="3507" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/cc/6ad68810a94c4.jpg" width="2630"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://cc.some.pics"&gt;@cc&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:13:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>昨晚Turnstile演出中，歌曲之间短暂而安静的一刻。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad68764ae92f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;昨晚Turnstile演出中，歌曲之间短暂而安静的一刻。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Drummer, bassist, and guitarist of Turnstile sitting down on stage. Dimly lit, much color." height="2883" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/cc/6ad68764ae92f.jpg" width="2162"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://cc.some.pics"&gt;@cc&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:11:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>#黑白星期一</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad67a43bd4aa</link><description>&lt;p&gt;#黑白星期一&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A b&amp;amp;w photo showing a view of a river through the branches of a Scots pine, with a straight bridge in the background. The water shimmers silver in places, and what little sky there is is white with mist." height="2976" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6ad67a43bd4aa.jpg" width="2976"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:15:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>尊重并不要求信仰一致。你和另一位女巫可能对咒语有不同理解，或偏好不同的方法。你们可以享受谈论彼此的魔法技艺，而不必试图说服对方。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad673d51a816</link><description>&lt;p&gt;尊重并不要求信仰一致。你和另一位女巫可能对咒语有不同理解，或偏好不同的方法。你们可以享受谈论彼此的魔法技艺，而不必试图说服对方。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-black and muted rose-pink fantasy scene of two witches sharing tea in a rooftop garden, holding a cord and a wooden charm amid rosemary pots, floating lanterns, and crescent-topped city towers. Warm ivory serif lettering fills the sky, with a gold botanical emblem at bottom-right. Text: Respect doesn't require matching beliefs. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad673d51a816.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:47:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>电脑又回到1998年</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad65e8b85f51</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的电脑上又完全是1998年的样子了……&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="file transfer aan 4.1 kb/sec" height="168" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6ad65e8b85f51.png" width="558"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:16:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>清晨湖畔远眺</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad650a53db2b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;清晨时分眺望湖面。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A vibrant, fiery sunset with orange, pink, and dark clouds illuminates the sky above a calm lake, which perfectly reflects the brilliant colors across its water and scattered lily pads." height="1350" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6ad650a53db2b.jpg" width="1800"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:17:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>瑞典胡丁厄晨雾美景</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad650887d6f2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;瑞典胡丁厄雾蒙蒙清晨的魔幻景象。未经编辑或裁剪。大自然尽显其美。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Misty autumn morning on a calm lake, with a wooden jetty reaching out from the left shore and reeds on the right, both mirrored in the still water while the far side fades into fog." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/birming/6ad650887d6f2.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://birming.some.pics"&gt;@birming&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:17:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>静谧印象护身符袋
